 - 2026-06-15: PHASE A1 (HEADLINE; cross-check the surprising win) -- LEAK-AUDIT the +44pp ARC oracle-distinct win. exp4245 won by +0.4423 (CI95 [0.308,0.596]) but positive labels = exact match to gold/GAP-4-INDUCED pred_grid and features include shape/palette-family + duplicate-counts that could encode candidate ORIGIN (induced-program output vs sampled candidate) rather than correctness -- a leaked/circular detector would inflate AUROC to ~0.96 and the delta to +44pp while NOT being oracle-distinct. AUDIT: (1) train an explicit candidate-ORIGIN probe (predict induced-vs-sampled from the features) and measure how predictive it is AND whether origin correlates with is_correct (the leak signature); (2) RE-RUN the decisive beats-vote gate with PROVENANCE-BLIND features (strip every origin-encoding feature, keep only genuinely oracle-distinct CONTENT signals: vote-priors, cross-candidate agreement, self-consistency margin); report the provenance-blind delta + CI95 vs the .393 +0.4423. Emit win_survives_provenance_blind BARE bool (delta>0 AND CI95 excl 0 on provenance-blind features). verifier_is_oracle=false. A SURVIVING win is decision-grade; a COLLAPSE (the win was provenance leak) is an even MORE important decision-grade negative that STOPS the DiffusionGemma scale-up. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: arc_set_encoder_win_survives_provenance_blind_audit; results/experiment_4256_arc_oracle_distinct_leak_audit.json
 - 2026-06-15: PHASE A2 (HEADLINE; cross-check the surprising win) -- MULTI-SEED + INDEPENDENT replication of the +44pp ARC oracle-distinct win. exp4245 reported delta +0.4423 on a SINGLE seed (4245), n=52. A surprising result is not headline-eligible until replicated (n>1 seeds, same direction; CLAUDE.md). RE-RUN the decisive beats-vote gate across >=5 SEEDS (independent fold reshuffles of the train/held-out split over the grown pool), report per-seed delta + the MEAN delta + a cross-seed CI (and flag any seed where the win flips sign). SEPARATELY, an INDEPENDENT clean-room re-score: reload the persisted A1/.393 pool artifact and recompute set_encoder@1, vote@1, oracle@K via a SECOND code path (not the .393 script) to confirm the numbers reproduce off the artifact (mirrors the G2 FoVer independent-reproducer pattern). Emit oracle_distinct_win_replicates BARE bool := (mean cross-seed delta>0 AND cross-seed CI excl 0 AND the independent re-score lands within the .393 CI). verifier_is_oracle=false. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: arc_oracle_distinct_win_replicates_multiseed; results/experiment_4257_arc_oracle_distinct_multiseed_replication.json
 - 2026-06-15: PHASE A3 (HEADLINE; the real OOD test) -- CROSS-GAME transfer of the ARC oracle-distinct verifier. The .393 win used HELD-OUT TASKS within the SAME games; the real generalization test is HELD-OUT GAMES. Carnot's own prior evidence warns this is where learned ARC signals collapse (ARC-1->ARC-2 transfer: induction 0.93->0.57, project_gap3_verifier_program). Split the grown pool BY GAME: train the set-encoder on a subset of games, test the beats-vote gate on candidates from games NEVER seen in training. Report cross_game_delta (set_encoder@1 - vote@1 on held-out GAMES) + CI95 + the held-out-game count + the within-game-vs-cross-game gap. A surviving cross-game win = a GENERAL selection signal (huge for the north star). A collapse = the verifier memorizes per-game basins (decision-grade; SCOPES the headline to within-game and refocuses .395 on cross-game generalization). verifier_is_oracle=false. (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_arc_game_ids_unrecoverable; results/experiment_4258_arc_oracle_distinct_cross_game_transfer.json
